","content":"我听见你希望被认真听完、不被急着否定，这很重要。家里那种“稳定、别惹事”的氛围，可能让你习惯把不同意见咽回去。你最近一次想唱反调却没敢说，是什么事？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"我听见你希望被认真听完、不被急着否定，这很重要。家里那种“稳定、别惹事”的氛围，可能让你习惯把不同意见咽回去。你最近一次想唱反调却没敢说，是什么事？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2567,"promptTokens":159,"completionTokens":234,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:42:48"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":27,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"6878a86d15d64827bf2e71c4d87fe32d","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0066921262575234675,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb3a859efdd2548214c11","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795142568473,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:42:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb3a859efdd2548214c11","chatId":"1dff0d0172b0494593ef18deb11569b5","sessionId":null,"userId":129545,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"我也说不好……可能就是别急着否定我，能认真听我把话说完。可在家里，我爸妈一直觉得稳定最重要，别去惹事，我好像从小就不太敢跟他们唱反调。<第13轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":26,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"6878a86d15d64827bf2e71c4d87fe32d","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0066921262575234675,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb3a859efdd2548214c12","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795142568470,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:42:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":n